          "id": "1776901730861",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1776901730861_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "DATA: {{$context.$nodes.SLICE_THE_TOP_5_ROWS.$output.result}}\n\nGenerate a multiRecordWidget using the data with columns:\n- \"Product Risk\"\n- \"At Risk\"\n- \"Renewal\"\n- \"Revenue\"\n\nset multiRecordWidget title: <Generate a 3-4 words based on the data>\nset multiRecordWidget description: <Generate a 1-2 professional sentence based on the data>\n\nFor the \"Product Risk\" column, use productName from each row and add a drillDownAction\nthat invokes ora.Invoke(launchRenewalAccount,{targetProductId:<productId>, targetProductId:<productName>,programType:Renewal}\")\nusing the productId and productName from each row.\n\nFor the \"At Risk\" column, use riskAccounts from each row but always convert it to a string.\n\nFor the \"Renewal\" column, use renewals from each row but always convert it to a string.\n\nFor the \"Revenue\" column, format revenue from each row into a human-readable string\nusing suffixes: \"B\" for billions, \"M\" for millions, and \"k\" for thousands.\nExamples: 1.23B, 3.45M, 100k.\nEnsure the revenue values are rounded to two decimal places when using suffixes.\n\n\n\nAlso, For the first row in the data set, create following low actionable insights:\n1. A low priority actionable insight with the following fields:\n- actionText: \"Launch <productName> Renewal Advisor\" (replace <productName> with the actual product name from the first row)\n- followUpCommand: ora.Invoke(\"launchRenewalAccount\",\"targetProductId=<productId>,targetProductName:<productName>\") from the first row\n- priority: false\n"
            },
            {
              "id": "1776901730861_systemPrompt",
              "name": "systemPrompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Generate oraInfoDisplay as per multiRecordWidget standards and oraInsight. Output must contain only oraInfoDisplay and oraInsight. No other extra text to be included in output"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM",
          "diagram": {
            "x": 5450,
            "y": 6982
