              "type": "string",
              "value": "DATA: {{$context.$nodes.SLICE_THE_TOP_5_ROWS.$output.result}}\n\nFor the first row in the data set, create following actionable insights:\n\n1. A high priority actionable insight with the following fields:\n- title: use the productName from the first row\n- shortDescription: generate a concise promotional description to promote Renewal on the productName\n- actionText: \"Launch Renewal Advisor\"\n- followUpCommand: ora.Invoke(\"launchRenewalAccount\",\"targetProductId=<productId>,targetProductName:<productName>\") from the first row\n- priority: true\n\n\nEnsure the output clearly distinguishes the insights and uses the exact field names as specified."
            },
